10
00:00:18,805 --> 00:00:20,435
Its weight and size should match

11
00:00:20,445 --> 00:00:22,005
the published specifications.

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,970
And on a certified bar,

13
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,010
the serial number should

14
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,200
match the certificate.

15
